 "description": "List the sites this signed-in account can analyze, in two groups. Each site includes its timezone and today's date in that timezone. Requires OAuth; no site registration is needed. Prefer my_sites; if site_id is omitted, analytics tools use the primary site. When my_sites is empty, analytics tools use the first curated demo site and identify it as sample data.",
